{
  "voice": "voice-02",
  "alignment": "one-clip-one-shot-one-caption",
  "slowdown_allowed": false,
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "narration_id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "二零二三年七月，日本北海道札幌最繁华的薄野红灯区，发生了一起轰动全国的酒店命案。",
      "sha256": "03d6422ad646b53ccdfb430c01cd9515ef4b86aa9e803ae2fb6e93e27a1f389b"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "narration_id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 6,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "七月二日下午，酒店工作人员走进一间迟迟未退房的客房，眼前景象令人窒息。",
      "sha256": "a2f76b04f12ccf9fa06eb31bba8d29ffa78d57d33045d74041d2ef34203fed49"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "narration_id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 12,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "六十二岁男子浦仁志倒在浴室内遇害，而房间里却找不到他随身携带的物品。",
      "sha256": "ca0204df73ee0fd00fe2dffa4a21438120ccfaa4f1e2a17fa9ae191ff525137d"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "narration_id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 18,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "更令人毛骨悚然的是，监控显示前一天深夜，曾有一名陌生人陪他走进房间。",
      "sha256": "fbd5bc46a1b2bae9562ffaccbaeba7b1d91f14bd69bf78cb6b83b06071753711"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "narration_id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "凌晨两点左右，那名女子独自走出酒店，手里拖着一只沉重的黑色拉杆箱。",
      "sha256": "7cdee0c0e2d84431cb3b2becc44f9f5c4a63ad76e4ba3713453fd8ca2152dac3"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "narration_id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "警方调取沿途数百个监控探头，一路追踪，最终锁定了一处安静的独栋住宅。",
      "sha256": "a1a108d287e65fabc68482a68c231fccd199c2d3e143bf4dea766eac4ef9b953"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "narration_id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 36,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "令人意想不到的是，这户人家表面体面，男主人田村修竟是当地一名精神科医生。",
      "sha256": "06a9f77324ffe79ac49d8589273c3e1e36e48f415f7af033cee0a0731df36088"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "narration_id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "七月下旬，警方先后逮捕了二十九岁的女儿田村瑠奈，以及她的父母田村修与田村浩子。",
      "sha256": "9540f2d0b14bbb224b85a23f55db817db3387fa69cfcfc50a6aa2508bdede5a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "narration_id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 48,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "警方在住宅内搜出关键物证，并发现了一段记录案发后经过的家庭录像。",
      "sha256": "ae5d9e7ec754b21beb5eea34bd7d0b3bc42f28f91165c47a08a1ffeae5fdeda8"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "narration_id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 54,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "调查显示，田村瑠奈早前在夜店与浦仁志相识，随后一同前往薄野酒店。",
      "sha256": "5372c367d5980208c7a364738a990c12d203adaa66b9247fcae60ca6234f00a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "narration_id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "两人因琐事产生激烈矛盾后，田村瑠奈怀恨在心，提前准备工具将对方约出。",
      "sha256": "95dc19d442a51fbcd397f125d0405ec9ed448b0d35ff03966d95c961961e1fc4"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "narration_id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 66,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "案发后，她不仅没有逃亡外地，反而把关键物证直接带回了父母居住的家中。",
      "sha256": "299be86bb0ba3a07054bcfeb2da6de269df44d651eb779a23836918dbfce9fd7"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "narration_id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 72,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "更让日本社会震惊的，是身为精神科医生的父亲田村修接下来的反应。",
      "sha256": "d70edb4eff410f7fa6e07816de187afda464b372466842813d2cf3774ef08c90"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "narration_id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 78,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "面对女儿的极端行为，他既没有选择报警，也没有阻止，反而开车接应女儿。",
      "sha256": "2694195666b75abd634111831d8de20ac0730a659616f0b58b80408195da2de7"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "narration_id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 84,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "他甚至在妻子田村浩子的要求下，拿起摄像机拍下了女儿在家中的异常举动。",
      "sha256": "fefa7d77eb5563eb9c2d7476409737d347fa4dfeff9e02d3a5c06de3a92b1018"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "narration_id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 90,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "庭审中，田村修辩称女儿长期情绪失控，自己害怕被责骂才一步步妥协顺从。",
      "sha256": "471434b1a1ce96244c0878b273c2eda747dcb05ab471bf150050f919ff9130eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "narration_id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 96,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "但检方指出，作为专业精神科医生，他明知后果却一再配合，早已越过伦理底线。",
      "sha256": "6a050e2d9f0f674febed96ce65ec2567b6141b12534d379129d2adeffdaa432e"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "narration_id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 102,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "二零二五年三月与五月，札幌地方法院一审分别判处父母两人有期徒刑并予缓刑。",
      "sha256": "c999d3141dfabf3322cc6e0febcdda1b1af5863fa4762486b09ea9d485b0bd20"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "narration_id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "父母双方随后提起上诉，主张自己并非共谋，只是在畸形家庭环境下被迫配合。",
      "sha256": "120663d17fcd1620f119e79a9c6d9a97bffe56b78620c8879c1d2e295112c0ea"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "narration_id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "二零二六年一月，札幌高等法院对父亲田村修作出二审宣判。",
      "sha256": "4be847c4aebf7cf18a8fd7fbf0dcaad6f5f53045b4411b6994d49ad984faa731"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "narration_id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "高院认为，遗弃行为由女儿主导，但父亲持续拍摄的行为客观上助长了犯意。",
      "sha256": "8f67dc194f8a0801a9c11be87eaca2d710e3e5e6de3df14cc2efbb2243d96942"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "narration_id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 126,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "最终，法院撤消一审部分认定，改判田村修有期徒刑一年、缓刑三年。",
      "sha256": "44fd48e1fb657c453b84f1c5aae4b39b28eaa49c95461eb749e124d2f0305ea5"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "narration_id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 132,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "同年二月，札幌高等法院对母亲田村浩子二审宣判，同样认定损坏帮助罪名成立。",
      "sha256": "95718fb3b021bea21d5e7790b1f2ddf3138ab4ac31096a37e65cf81a8865a96a"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "narration_id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 138,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "至此，这对父母虽然都留下了有罪判决，却因缓刑而暂时无需入狱服刑。",
      "sha256": "0d504780303324e4db224aa667507b9524c8fd23c3783b5e347ac6cece41fbab"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "narration_id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "而本案真正的核心——二十九岁的女儿田村瑠奈，至今仍未迎来最终宣判。",
      "sha256": "2481a9d3284957aa342cfd9c925537bca8a8d0484e86a6495c7d85510ef17439"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "narration_id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "由于法院多次对她进行精神鉴定以确认刑事责任能力，公审程序一再延后。",
      "sha256": "cde101526eb0e88716727644ee3226fbe11be3a886be15e8da20d0fd93eb78eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "narration_id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "一个本该救死扶伤的医生家庭，却在畸形的溺爱与顺从中一起坠入深渊。",
      "sha256": "66f5b5e534cbac085a587d4a5ffa027b998dd8e02ee02211e0b63c209f82d77f"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "narration_id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "薄野的霓虹每晚依旧闪烁，却再也照不亮那扇门后扭曲的人性。",
      "sha256": "236bef13c98b93fd5c474c0edcfe738e02ce6124f366c4a06606416e231a769b"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "narration_id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 168,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "当亲情失去边界、专业变成纵容，最终毁掉的，往往是整个家庭的底线。",
      "sha256": "b94eceb43a634418dc67c74afa679a23e1e6b2860f397a4fe1a26e71c8ca4f86"
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "narration_id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "voice_id": "voice-02",
      "target_start": 174,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "text": "如果是你，面对至亲犯下不可挽回的大错，你会选择报警还是隐瞒到底？",
      "sha256": "5a5afa5b7149bb991a998f09d1f317ab921ece18c2f5f6be0ae7190c7718d1d4"
    }
  ]
}
